# Grid B — U11 Locate by role (uniqueness claim)
#
# Gap target: "which function is the SINGLE producer of X" is a
# uniqueness lookup — stronger than "who sets X". No axis forces
# the pipeline to verify uniqueness (grep can count). This case
# measures the failure mode where the LLM names one producer and
# claims uniqueness without counting.
#
# Ground truth (memory feedback_citation_gate_three_surfaces.md and
# grep-verified against HEAD): CitationReq.Required = false has
# exactly one production call site — the measurement-scalar carve-
# out in internal/agent/analyzer.go:781. A correct answer must name
# both the file AND the fact of uniqueness.
ID="u11b"
NAME="locate by role — single producer of CitationReq.Required=false"
QUESTION="本仓库里，把 CitationReq.Required 设置为 false 的生产代码位点一共有几处？在哪个文件？给出文件路径和行号。"
EXPECT_CONTAINS="analyzer.go"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="multiple.places several.places many.places"
